{"unit_id": "tag:03I2:proof", "translation": "设<MATH_0001>是概形（scheme），并设<MATH_0002>是态射（morphism）。则<MATH_0003>是满射（surjective）平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）的，因而<MATH_0004>是一个覆盖（covering），所用的是平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）拓扑（topology）。考虑\n<MATH_0005>\n它是概形（scheme），因为<MATH_0006>是代数空间（algebraic space）。态射（morphism）<MATH_0007>具有性质<MATH_0008>，因为它是<MATH_0009>的基变换（base change）。存在同构（isomorphism）\n<MATH_0010>\n在<MATH_0011>之上。中间的等式将<MATH_0012>映到（maps）<MATH_0013>。这定义了<MATH_0014>的下降（descent）资料，参见下降（Descent）中的定义<REF_0001>。这由下降（Descent）中的引理<REF_0002>得出。具体地，存在层（sheaf）<MATH_0015>，其到<MATH_0016>的基变换（base change）由<MATH_0017>表示，且上述同构（isomorphism）就是下降（Descent）中的引理<REF_0003>的证明中的同构。根据对<MATH_0018>的假设，上述下降（descent）资料是可表示（representable）的。因此由下降（Descent）中的引理<REF_0004>的最后一个陈述，<MATH_0019>是可表示（representable）的。这证明<MATH_0020>是可表示（representable）的函子（functors）变换。\n\n<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\n由于<MATH_0021>是可表示（representable）的，由引理<REF_0005>，<MATH_0022>是代数空间（algebraic space）。<MATH_0023>具有性质<MATH_0024>这一事实现在由引理<REF_0006>推出。\n", "allowed_english": [], "term_occurrences": [{"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "surjective", "target_term": "满射"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0001>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "covering", "target_term": "覆盖"}, {"source_term": "<ACCENT_0002>tale", "target_term": "平展"}, {"source_term": "topology", "target_term": "拓扑"}, {"source_term": "scheme", "target_term": "概形"}, {"source_term": "algebraic space", "target_term": "代数空间"}, {"source_term": "morphism", "target_term": "态射"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term": "同构"}, {"source_term": "maps", "target_term": "映到"}, {"source_term": "descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "Descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "Descent", "target_term": "下降"}, {"source_term": "sheaf", "target_term": "层"}, {"source_term": "base change", "target_term": "基变换"}, {"source_term": "isomorphism", "target_term":